      "writtenOn": "2021-04-14T08:38:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When the UCE framework receives the publish request, some pre-check and re-calculate the publish allowed time will be done and then sent the publish request to the looper.\n\nIn this bug, the UCE framework received two consecutive publishing request in a short period of time. It caused that the two publish requests were simultaneously processing pre-check before sent to the looper caused unexpected behaviors. Therefore, the lock is to protect the checks before sending to the looper.",
      "parentUuid": "1d181e98_1ccce2e8",
      "revId": "7a31a69a0fefdf6b67bc5c2388934968e2b500b9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
